{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{I}_\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-stackification-inertia}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3cef4e85daed6cd43f49fe57da72f72c1a7f84bec27a94b8942ad8f32978be9d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:845cf4e98af59f64bf1ad1191ff2c03252964934f342b23ec0ef9ae9890a44d4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a fibred category over <MATH_0003>.\nThe stackification of the inertia fibred category <MATH_0004>\nis inertia of the stackification of <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:350524eaabb348ff19e4d46b734b964158f27b279e9f2a21369fb7995c4ac882", "unit_id": "tag:06NS:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stackification-fibre-product-fibred-categories}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-lemma-inertia-fibred-category}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a9a981072064482ca7927fdc59224d790ade486b11fb971266085a2caac5fec9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8de479dcf17a345b3ff8b0214035d43681049cd5ea35c8cc49e1f98494566c87", "source_text": "This follows from the fact that stackification is compatible\nwith <MATH_0001>-fibre products by\nLemma <REF_0001>\nand the fact that there is a formula for the inertia in terms of\n<MATH_0002>-fibre products of categories over <MATH_0003>, see\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:23d0c9b7a7e1f436e4faa7ba1b054940672171e9031c8982771da523ca291fe0", "unit_id": "tag:06NS:proof"}
